{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05299","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得明字 · 窦希玠","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得明字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"銮舆巡上苑，凤驾瞰层城。\n御座丹乌丽，宸居白鹤惊。\n玉旗萦桂叶，金杯泛菊英。\n九晨陪圣膳，万岁奉承明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦希玠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}